[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://b6jb54u5hnmf4"]

; One variable: a baked lightmap. The LightmapGI's bake, in `unit-lightmap-gi-baked.lmbake` and its
; `.exr` atlas, holds a Static sun's light, its shadow and one red bounce onto the ground. The sun
; is Static, so it lights neither mesh in real time: every shade on the box and the ground comes
; from the atlas through each mesh's UV2. No other scene reads a lightmap, so none shows a wrong
; atlas read, slice, UV2 scale or bicubic filter.

[ext_resource type="LightmapGIData" uid="uid://cq6e4ueye16gs" path="res://unit-lightmap-gi-baked.lmbake" id="1_7qjqn"]

